# UEFI bootloader assets. mkarchiso reads loader entries from here when
# bootmodes contains `uefi.grub` or `uefi.systemd-boot`.
#
# Concretely we'll want:
#   loader/loader.conf
#   loader/entries/shokunin.conf
# once we move past scaffolding. For now mkarchiso falls back to the
# defaults shipped in /usr/share/archiso/configs/.
